---
import Layout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Open source" active="open-source">
  <section class="page-intro wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Built here. Shared openly.</span>
    <h1>
      Useful to us.<br />Yours to <em>build on.</em>
    </h1>
    <div class="intro-row">
      <p>Tools born from real projects, shared with the people making what comes next.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/idlefusion"> Find us on GitHub ↗ </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap oss-feature">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">01 / Swift package</span>
      <h2>HealthKit<br />Run Generator</h2>
      <p>
        Realistic running workout data for developers. Create outdoor runs with GPS routes or indoor
        treadmill sessions, complete with heart rate, cadence, pace, and elevation.
      </p>
      <ul class="plain-list" style="margin-bottom:28px">
        <li>Five run profiles, from easy runs to race day</li>
        <li>Deterministic seeds for reproducible test data</li>
        <li>Training plans and batch generation</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button" href="https://github.com/mps/healthkit-run-generator">
          View the source ↗
        </a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/healthkit-run-generator/">Project documentation ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="code-art" aria-label="HealthKit Run Generator capabilities">
      <span class="eyebrow"> A runner’s world. A developer’s tool. </span>
      <pre><span class="code-comment">// More realistic data. Less setup.</span>
<br /><br />Outdoor runs   → GPS + elevation<br />Indoor runs    → Treadmill + incline<br />Run profiles   → Easy, tempo, intervals<br />Reproducible   → Seed-based generation<br />Output         → HealthKit + JSON</pre><div
        class="code-bottom"
      >
        <span>SWIFT PACKAGE</span>
        <span>iOS 17+ · macOS 14+</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="service-band">
    <div class="wrap service-band-inner">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">An ongoing practice</span>
        <h2>
          Make something.<br />Share what <em>helps.</em>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div style="align-self:center">
        <p>
          Our open-source work grows out of the problems we encounter while building products.
          Explore the code, open an issue, or contribute an improvement.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/mps/healthkit-run-generator">
          Explore the repository ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
